# Patterns here are relative to fixtures/.
#
# The archived Aviation Weather Center payloads are captured evidence. Their manifest records
# the SHA-256 of the UPSTREAM response rather than of the committed file, so end-of-line
# translation would not fail a check here — it would quietly make the committed capture differ
# from the bytes that were actually captured, which is worse because nothing would say so.
#
# Held byte-exact for the same reason as data/snapshots. See data/.gitattributes.
weather/*.json -text
